---
/**
 * The mark beside the name, as on the landing page.
 *
 * It replaces Starlight's own title rather than using the `logo` option, so the name keeps the
 * display face beside the mark. The mark is the landing page's indigo logo (public/favicon.svg, a
 * copy of landing/public/favicon.svg): its colours are the logo's own and do not change with the
 * theme.
 */
---
<a href="/" class="site-title">
  <img src="/favicon.svg" width="26" height="26" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <span>supertoolkit</span>
</a>
<style>
  .site-title {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-family: var(--stk-display); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
